== Notes ==

* This spell displaces earlier castings of itself.
* Since [[creature weapon]]s have special treatment with regards to penetrating damage reduction, this spell can be used to enhance the ability of many [[summon]]ed (and [[polymorph]]ed) creatures to penetrate the damage reduction of others. (Having X/+5 damage reduction allows attacks with creature weapons to pierce others' damage reduction as a +5 weapon.)

